## ObjectType: Quality Inspection

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| inspection_id | Inspection id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | inspection_id |
| lot_id | Lot id | string | Foreign key to lots; blank creates no edge. | lot_id |
| location_id | Location id | string | Foreign key to locations; blank creates no edge. | location_id |
| inspection_date | Inspection date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | inspection_date |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | known_date |
| result | Result | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: Failed, Passed, Pending. | result |
| result_code | Result code | string | Stable machine code; localized display value is separate. Allowed values: failed, passed, pending. | result_code |
| reason | Reason | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | reason |

